  "id": "eye-contact",
  "term": "eye contact",
  "definition": "Eye contact is the spontaneous mutual looking between two people that naturally occurs during social interaction. People vary in how often they make eye-to-eye contact, and this variation can reflect differences in social behavior and influence how partners coordinate attention with each other.",
